WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.102
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)
-I tell you... (CHUCKLES)

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:02.869
...what a week.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:05.138
First, Margot Robbie
gets snubbed at the Oscars,

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:07.740
then Taylor Swift gets booed
at the football game.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.209
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.444
If you know
a rich, blonde bombshell,

00:00:12.511 --> 00:00:17.116
-give her a hug.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:18.184
Yeah.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:23.156
No, the only bottle blonde
who did good this week

00:00:23.222 --> 00:00:25.859
-was Donald Trump. (CHUCKLES)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:30.429
-He, uh... He won the-- (LAUGHS)
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:32.665
Yeah, he won the--
Now, he won New Hampshire.

00:00:32.731 --> 00:00:33.899
I mean-- And, of course,

00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:35.768
very gracious in defeat
as always.

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.069
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:39.038
He... He... He beat Nikki Haley,

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.374
who was the only hope
of something to go past Trump.

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:43.576
No, that didn't happen,
so he's furious.

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:45.345
His whole speech
was about how furious he is

00:00:45.411 --> 00:00:47.346
that Nikki Haley is staying
in the race!

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:49.882
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:52.117
And I get it,
it breaks a lifelong precedent

00:00:52.184 --> 00:00:54.219
where he finishes first
and the woman leaves.

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:57.423
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.460
Oh, I kid, Donald Trump,
it's all in good fun.

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:01.895
Uh...

00:01:03.629 --> 00:01:06.032
No, I know he's gonna be--
You know, it's...

00:01:06.098 --> 00:01:08.100
Boy, it's sad, it's--
The whole thing is over now.

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:10.136
There's not even a race
to follow,

00:01:10.202 --> 00:01:11.437
but that was always fun.

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:13.772
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:13.839 --> 00:01:15.942
And Trump
is beating Biden, you know,

00:01:16.008 --> 00:01:17.810
now in the national polls
pretty strongly,

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:20.279
and, um, all my
Democratic friends are saying,

00:01:20.379 --> 00:01:23.149
"Relax, it's a long time
before the election,"

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:25.918
'cause, yeah, that's what
Biden's whole card is,

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:32.559
-time.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.027
No, that's--
We gotta get used to it.

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:36.362
This is it, this is the race.

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:38.598
Biden and Trump,
the race is over.

00:01:38.931 --> 00:01:40.867
This is bad news
for the country, I think.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.436
Very good news
for people who build ramps

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:44.637
on debate stages.

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:48.374
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:50.443
You know... (CHUCKLES)

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:54.147
-You know that, uh-- (CHUCKLES)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:57.483
-Bill Clinton... (LAUGHS)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.318
Bill Clinton, uh,

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:01.320
has been out of office
for 25 years,

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:02.888
is still younger
than both of them.

00:02:02.955 --> 00:02:04.156
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:04.223 --> 00:02:07.260
I'm not kidding about that.
That is a true fact.

00:02:08.427 --> 00:02:11.464
Their combined age
is 158 years old.

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:13.633
The first... The first debate
is gonna be

00:02:13.699 --> 00:02:15.468
at the Museum
of Natural History.

00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:20.839
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-Uh, well, I don't think...

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:23.376
I don't think there's going
to be a debate.

00:02:23.442 --> 00:02:24.743
I don't think
either one wants it.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:26.545
I don't want it,
you don't want it, let's just...

00:02:26.612 --> 00:02:27.613
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.282
Because neither one of them
is really up to it.

00:02:29.348 --> 00:02:31.116
They're starting-- You know
what's trending on Twitter?

00:02:31.183 --> 00:02:32.585
Dementia Don.

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:35.021
-Because...
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:35.087 --> 00:02:37.122
Because... (CHUCKLES)

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:39.892
-(LAUGHS) Because Trump...
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:42.128
...Trump was talking
about Nancy Pelosi

00:02:42.194 --> 00:02:43.997
during, uh, January 6,

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:45.798
but he kept
calling her Nikki Haley.

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:48.534
-"Nikki Haley did this."
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:50.970
He also referred
to the president of North Korea

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:52.305
as Rae Dawn Chong.

00:02:52.372 --> 00:02:57.477
-I thought that was...
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:02:57.543 --> 00:02:58.578
Yeah.

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:00.813
The other-- (LAUGHS) Yeah.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.748
You know what else Dementia Don
said this week?

00:03:03.115 --> 00:03:04.150
This is a direct quote,

00:03:04.216 --> 00:03:05.685
I don't know what it means,
no one does.

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:07.220
He said, word for word,

00:03:07.487 --> 00:03:10.723
"We are an institute
in powerful death penalty,

00:03:11.223 --> 00:03:12.658
we will put this on."

00:03:12.858 --> 00:03:18.898
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:03:19.031 --> 00:03:20.900
Even Biden was like,
"What the fuck?"

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.536
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

